{
 "brief": "Israeli forces seized 2,224 dunams of land in Salfit governorate, the Shehab Wire reported. The confiscation represents a further expansion of territorial control in the West Bank Palestinian territory and adds to the cumulative land appropriations documented in the region.\n\nSalfit, located in the central West Bank, has experienced repeated land seizures over the past two decades. The governorate's agricultural land and natural resources have been subject to ongoing appropriation by Israeli authorities, constraining Palestinian access to territory and economic resources.",
